# Download Android source with patches(local_manifests)
 Refer to http://source.android.com/source/downloading.html
 $ repo init -u https://mirrors.bfsu.edu.cn/git/AOSP/platform/manifest --depth=1 -b android-10.0.0_r32 --repo-url=https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/git-repo
 $ git clone http://192.168.101.121:8080/local_manifests .repo/local_manifests -b android10
 $ repo sync

# Build for Raspberry Pi3
 https://github.com/rpi3bdroid/device_brcm_rpi3/tree/android10

Use -j[n] option on sync & build steps, if build host has a good number of CPU cores.
The build is tested on XUbuntu 26.04 LTS.

Graphics HAL of this build : https://github.com/anholt/mesa/wiki/VC4
